#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kde; 3.2 a common menu format is introduced at <ulink url=\"http://"
"freedesktop.org/Standards/menu-spec/\">http://freedesktop.org/Standards/menu-"
"spec/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"ក្នុង KDE ៣.២ ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ម៉ឺនុយ​ទូទៅ​គឺ​ត្រូវ​បាន​ណែនាំ​​នៅ <ulink url=\"http://freedesktop.org/"
"Standards/menu-spec/\">http://freedesktop.org/Standards/menu-spec/</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1396
#, no-c-format
msgid "Before &kde; 3.2:"
msgstr "មុន KDE ៣.២ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Directory structure under <filename class=\"directory\">share/applnk</"
"filename>"
msgstr "រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ថត​នៅ <filename class=\"directory\">share/applnk</filename>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1402
#, no-c-format
msgid "Directory structure represents menu structure"
msgstr "រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ថត​តំណាង​ឲ្យ​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ម៉ឺនុយ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each <literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> file represents a single "
"application"
msgstr "ឯកសារ <literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> នីមួយៗ​តំណាង​ឲ្យ​កម្មវិធី​មួយ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It was difficult to rearrange the structure in &kde; 3.2 so the new menu "
"format:"
msgstr "វា​ពិបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​តម្រៀប​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​​ក្នុង KDE ៣.២ ឡើង​វិញ ដូច្នេះ​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ម៉ឺនុយ​ថ្មី ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1414
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defines structure in a single .menu file"
msgstr "កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​ឯកសារ .menu តែ​មួយ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is based on categories"
msgstr "​ផ្អែក​លើ​ប្រភេទ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1416
#, no-c-format
msgid "is shared between <acronym>GNOME</acronym> and &kde;"
msgstr "ត្រូវ​បាន​ចែក​រំលែក​រវាង <acronym>GNOME</acronym> និង KDE"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1417
#, no-c-format
msgid "Supports applnk style menus as well"
msgstr "គាំទ្រ​ម៉ឺនុយ​រចនាប័ទ្ម applnk ផង​ដែរ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1422 kde-for-admins.docbook:1484
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example from <filename>applications.menu</filename>:"
msgstr "ឧទាហរណ៍​ពី <filename>applications.menu</filename> ៖"

